      "settings": {
        "kicker": "// POWER, RANGE & EVERYDAY UTILITY",
        "heading": "BUILT FOR MORE THAN THE DAILY RIDE",
        "subheading": "The MF-35 is an affordable folding electric tricycle for adults with 750W power, removable battery convenience, Shimano 7-speed shifting, and dependable payload capacity for everyday riding.",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "feature_1": {
      "type": "mf35-stitch-feature",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_layout": "image_right",
        "kicker": "Quick-Fold Action",
        "title": "Low Step-Through <br>Tool-Free Folding",
        "body": "<p>The MF-35 folding electric tricycle features a low step-through frame with a 12-inch standover height, making it easier to get on and off. Whether you’re an older rider who values added convenience, wearing a skirt or dress, or a shorter rider, the low step-through design helps make mounting and dismounting more comfortable. When it’s time to store the trike, simply release the quick-release latch to fold the frame, no tools required, for space-saving storage in a garage, apartment, RV, or other compact space.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_2707.jpg",
        "stat_1_value": "5'1\"",
        "stat_1_label": "Min Rider Ht",
        "stat_1_accent": false,
        "stat_2_value": "5'9\"",
        "stat_2_label": "Max Rider Ht",
        "stat_2_accent": false,
        "bullet_1": "Easy access for a wider range of adult riders.",
        "bullet_2": "Folded overall dimenslons：",
        "caption_label": "// REAL-WORLD PORTABILITY",
        "caption_body": "Fold Fold and unfold in under 10 seconds without detaching wheels or wiring cables.unfold in under 10 seconds without detaching wheels or wiring cables.",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "feature_2": {
      "type": "mf35-stitch-feature",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_layout": "image_left",
        "kicker": "Powerful performance",
        "title": "750W Power for Everyday <br>Hills and Cargo Runs",
        "body": "<p>The MF-35 folding electric tricycle features a 750W rear-wheel-drive brushless motor with up to 1200W of peak power for smooth starts, steady acceleration, and dependable everyday assistance. Whether you are running errands, carrying daily essentials, or navigating neighborhood streets and everyday inclines, it provides added support when you need it. Shimano 7-speed shifting helps you ride more comfortably across changing road conditions, while the brushless design helps reduce routine maintenance.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSC_2749_31efc17a-b62b-486f-a5b7-f15bc148968f.jpg",
        "stat_1_value": "Rear Drive Motor",
        "stat_1_label": "",
        "stat_1_accent": false,
        "stat_2_value": "5-LEVEL PEDAL ASSIST",
        "stat_2_label": "",
        "stat_2_accent": true,
        "bullet_1": "Brushless, Low-Maintenance Design",
        "bullet_2": "Smooth, Dependable Power for Everyday Rides",
        "caption_label": "// CONFIDENT REAR-WHEEL DRIVE",
        "caption_body": "Step strSteady rear-wheel power for smoother starts and everyday rides.aight through — no swinging leg over crossbar required.",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
      }
    },
    "feature_3": {
      "type": "mf35-stitch-feature",
      "settings": {
        "desktop_layout": "image_right",
        "kicker": "Flexible Charging",
        "title": "Removable Battery<br>Flexible Charging",
        "body": "<p>The MF-35 folding electric tricycle features a 48V 13AH rear-mounted removable lithium battery that can be charged on or off the trike for added everyday convenience. Simply remove the battery and charge it indoors when the trike is stored in a garage, apartment parking area, or other location without easy access to an outlet. A full charge takes approximately 6.75 hours with the included charger.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Capture01528.jpg",
        "stat_1_value": "Removable, Rear-Mounted Battery",
        "stat_1_label": "",
        "stat_1_accent": false,
        "stat_2_value": "",
        "stat_2_label": "",
        "stat_2_accent": false,
        "bullet_1": "Triple Mechanical Disc Brake Calipers — 160mm front and dual rear rotor configuration stops 400 lbs smoothly under any wet or dusty road conditions.",
        "bullet_2": "Dual Integrated Parking Levers — Lock your trike instantly at the brake levers when loading heavy groceries or parking on a 15-degree driveway incline.",
        "caption_label": "",
        "caption_body": "",
        "padding_top": 60,
        "padding_bottom": 60
